### 1. Crea Diego (id 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Diego" }

### 2. Crea Anna (id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Anna" }

### 3. Diego crea la stanza: copia l'inviteCode dalla risposta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "creatorId": 1 }

### 4. Anna entra
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/RZ6QDV/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2 }

### 5. Diego dice sì a Inception (film 1) → match: false
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/RZ6QDV/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "filmId": 1, "liked": true }

### 6. Anna dice sì a Inception → match: true 🎉
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/RZ6QDV/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "filmId": 1, "liked": true }

### 7. Diego vota di nuovo Inception → 409 "Film already voted"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/A7KXHV/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "filmId": 1, "liked": false }


### Prossimo film per Diego → Inception (film 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/GT3GE3/next-film?userId=1

### Diego vota Inception
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/GT3GE3/swipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "filmId": 1, "liked": true }

### Prossimo film per Diego → ora Star Trek (film 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/GT3GE3/next-film?userId=1

### Prossimo film per Anna → ancora Inception, perché lei non l'ha votato
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/GT3GE3/next-film?userId=2

### I match della stanza
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/RZ6QDV/matches